        'tipsCard.heading': '💡 Pro Tips',
        'tipsCard.contact.1': 'Use a professional email address (e.g., first.last@gmail.com).',
        'tipsCard.contact.2': 'Add your LinkedIn profile to showcase your network and endorsements.',
        'tipsCard.contact.3': 'Only add your full address if required for the job.',
        'tipsCard.summary.1': 'Keep it brief: 3-5 sentences.',
        'tipsCard.summary.2': 'Tailor it to the job description, using keywords from the listing.',
        'tipsCard.summary.3': 'Highlight your biggest achievements and top skills.',
        'tipsCard.experience.1': 'Use action verbs (e.g., \'Managed\', \'Developed\', \'Led\').',
        'tipsCard.experience.2': 'Quantify your achievements with numbers (e.g., \'Increased sales by 20%\').',
        'tipsCard.experience.3': 'List responsibilities in bullet points for easy reading.',
        'tipsCard.projects.1': 'Showcase your best work, especially projects relevant to the job you\'re applying for.',
        'tipsCard.projects.2': 'Briefly describe the project, its purpose, and the technologies you used.',
        'tipsCard.projects.3': 'Include a link to the live project or its source code repository (like GitHub).',
        'tipsCard.projects.4': 'Quantify outcomes if possible (e.g., \'Handled 1000 requests per second\').',
        'tipsCard.education.1': 'If you\'re a recent grad, put this section before Experience.',
        'tipsCard.education.2': 'Include relevant coursework, projects, or honors.',
        'tipsCard.education.3': 'It\'s generally okay to leave out your graduation year if you\'ve been in the workforce for over 10 years.',
        'tipsCard.skills.1': 'Include both \'hard skills\' (like \'Python\', \'Photoshop\') and \'soft skills\' (like \'Team Leadership\', \'Communication\').',
        'tipsCard.skills.2': 'Don\'t list skills you aren\'t proficient in.',
        'tipsCard.skills.3': 'Check the job description for required skills and add them if you have them.',
        'tipsCard.certifications.1': 'List your most relevant certifications first to grab the recruiter\'s attention.',
        'tipsCard.certifications.2': 'Include the full, official name of the certification to ensure it\'s recognized by ATS.',
        'tipsCard.certifications.3': 'If a certification has an expiry date, make sure to include it, especially if it\'s still active.',
        'tipsCard.languages.1': 'List languages you are professionally proficient in.',
        'tipsCard.languages.2': 'Use standard proficiency levels like \'Native\', \'Fluent\', or \'Conversational\'.',
        'tipsCard.languages.3': 'Only include languages if they are relevant to the job or you have a high proficiency.',
        'tipsCard.awards.1': 'Highlight recognition that demonstrates excellence in your field.',
        'tipsCard.awards.2': 'Include awards from professional associations, previous employers, or academic institutions.',
        'tipsCard.awards.3': 'Briefly explain the significance of the award if it\'s not immediately obvious.',
        'tipsCard.trainings.1': 'List workshops, bootcamps, or seminars that enhanced your professional skills.',
        'tipsCard.trainings.2': 'Focus on training that is relevant to the position you are applying for.',
        'tipsCard.trainings.3': 'Include the organizing body and date to add credibility.',
        'tipsCard.publications.1': 'List articles, books, or research papers you have authored or co-authored.',
        'tipsCard.publications.2': 'Include the title, publication date, and publisher or journal name.',
        'tipsCard.publications.3': 'Add a link to the publication if available online.',
        'tipsCard.volunteer.1': 'Highlight volunteer roles that demonstrate leadership or relevant skills.',
        'tipsCard.volunteer.2': 'Include the organization name, your role, and the dates of service.',
        'tipsCard.volunteer.3': 'Describe your impact or key contributions, similar to professional experience.',
        'tipsCard.custom.1': 'Use this section for anything that doesn\'t fit elsewhere, like Hobbies, Interests, or Patents.',
        'tipsCard.custom.2': 'Keep it relevant to the job or showcase your personality in a professional way.',
        'tipsCard.custom.3': 'Ensure the title clearly describes the content of this section.',
        'tipsCard.customize.1': 'Enable sections that showcase your unique strengths.',
        'tipsCard.customize.2': 'Hide sections that are empty or not relevant to the specific job application.',
        'tipsCard.customize.3': 'Tailoring your resume structure can help emphasize your most impactful qualifications.',
        'tipsCard.finalize.1': 'Proofread everything! Check for spelling and grammar errors.',
        'tipsCard.finalize.2': 'Ask a friend or colleague to review your resume.',
