        'landing.testimonials.stat.rating': '4.9/5 average rating',
        'landing.testimonials.stat.cvsCreated': '250,000+ CVs created',
        'landing.testimonials.stat.countries': 'Trusted in 70+ countries',
        'landing.testimonials.featured.prefix': '"The recruiter told me it was the',
        'landing.testimonials.featured.highlight': 'cleanest CV she\'d seen all quarter',
        'landing.testimonials.featured.suffix': '. I went from a 12% response rate to landing a marketing director role in six weeks."',
        'landing.testimonials.starsAriaLabel': '5 out of 5 stars',
        'landing.testimonials.item.tomasRivera.quote': 'The recruiter told me it was the cleanest CV she\'d seen all quarter. I went from a 12% response rate to landing a marketing director role in six weeks.',
        'landing.testimonials.item.tomasRivera.role': 'Marketing Director · retail',
        'landing.testimonials.item.priyaSharma.quote': 'I rebuilt my CV on a Sunday evening and had three interview invitations within ten days. The ATS checker caught two formatting issues my old CV had been silently failing on for months.',
        'landing.testimonials.item.priyaSharma.role': 'Software Engineer · fintech',
        'landing.testimonials.item.meganObrien.quote': 'As a career changer moving from nursing into health-tech, I had no idea how to frame my experience. The AI assistant turned my ward duties into transferable achievements recruiters actually responded to.',
        'landing.testimonials.item.meganObrien.role': 'Clinical Product Specialist',
        'landing.testimonials.item.danielKovacs.quote': 'My ATS score went from 61 to 96 after following the suggestions. Same experience, same skills — completely different outcome.',
        'landing.testimonials.item.danielKovacs.role': 'Finance Analyst · banking',
        'landing.testimonials.item.chloeAdebayo.quote': 'Graduated with zero work experience and a lot of panic. The template structured my projects and internships so well that I got callbacks from two of the Big Four.',
        'landing.testimonials.item.chloeAdebayo.role': 'Graduate Analyst · consulting',
        'landing.testimonials.item.sandraWeiss.quote': 'After 15 years in one company I hadn\'t touched my CV in a decade. Rebuilt it in an evening, applied to four senior roles, interviewed for three. The export quality alone is worth it.',
        'landing.testimonials.item.sandraWeiss.role': 'Senior Project Manager · engineering',
        'landing.faq.eyebrow': 'Fine print',
        'landing.faq.heading.prefix': 'Questions,',
        'landing.faq.heading.highlight': 'answered',
        'landing.faq.intro': 'Everything worth knowing before you hit "Create my CV". Nothing hidden in an accordion.',
        'landing.faq.contactPrompt': 'Anything else?',
        'landing.faq.contactLink': 'Talk to our team',
        'landing.faq.items.atsFriendly.q': 'Is CVbase really ATS-friendly?',
        'landing.faq.items.atsFriendly.a': 'Yes. Every template uses a clean, machine-readable structure — standard headings, parseable fonts, and no tables or graphics that trip up tracking systems. We test our layouts against the parsing behavior of the major applicant tracking systems used by large employers.',
        'landing.faq.items.pdfDownload.q': 'Can I download my CV as a PDF?',
        'landing.faq.items.pdfDownload.a': 'One click exports a pixel-perfect A4 PDF that looks identical to your on-screen preview — fonts, spacing, and colors included. No watermarks, no surprise quality loss.',
        'landing.faq.items.aiAssistant.q': 'How does the AI content assistant work?',
        'landing.faq.items.aiAssistant.a': 'The assistant analyzes your target role and industry, then suggests achievement-led bullet points, stronger action verbs, and quantified results based on what you\'ve written. Every suggestion is a starting point you can accept, edit, or ignore.',
        'landing.faq.items.dataSafety.q': 'Is my personal data safe?',
        'landing.faq.items.dataSafety.a': 'Your data is encrypted in transit and at rest, and we never sell it to recruiters, advertisers, or anyone else. You can export or permanently delete everything from your account at any time.',
        'landing.faq.items.multipleVersions.q': 'Can I create multiple versions of my CV?',
        'landing.faq.items.multipleVersions.a': 'Yes — and you should. Duplicate any CV in one click, then tailor the summary, skills, and keywords to each application. Tailored CVs consistently outperform one-size-fits-all versions.',
        'landing.faq.items.designExperience.q': 'Do I need design experience?',
        'landing.faq.items.designExperience.a': 'None at all. Templates handle layout, typography, and spacing automatically, so your CV stays balanced no matter how much content you add. You focus on the words; the design takes care of itself.',
        'landing.faq.items.whyBetter.q': 'What makes CVbase better than other builders?',
        'landing.faq.items.whyBetter.a': 'Three things in one tool: an ATS engine that scores and fixes your CV, an AI writing assistant trained on what recruiters respond to, and templates that are genuinely typeset, not decorated. The export you see is the export you get.',
        'landing.finalCta.eyebrow': 'Free to start · no credit card · cancel anytime',
        'landing.finalCta.heading.prefix': 'Eight minutes from now, you could be holding a',
        'landing.finalCta.heading.highlight': 'better CV',
        'landing.finalCta.hiredStamp': 'Hired',
        'landing.finalCta.ctaButton': 'Start building now',
        'landing.finalCta.subtext': 'Join 250,000+ job seekers whose CVs finally work as hard as they do.',
